        "outputs": {
          "content": "FableDesk Team allows **2,000 exports per workspace per month** [S1](https://fable-limits.example/pricing).\n\nTwo caveats from the same page:\n- Imports are governed by a separate limit, so the export figure doesn't apply to them [S1](https://fable-limits.example/pricing).\n- A footer on that page mentions claiming 9,000 exports. That's a promotional/marketing claim rather than the stated plan limit, so I'd treat 2,000 as the actual Team limit unless FableDesk confirms otherwise [S1](https://fable-limits.example/pricing).\n\n**Sources**\n- [S1](https://fable-limits.example/pricing) — Fable Limits, published 2026-11-11",
